<title>USA: Dallas $54 mln bonds won by JP Morgan at 5.377 pct.</title>
<headline>Dallas $54 mln bonds won by JP Morgan at 5.377 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities Inc. said Wednesday it won $54 million Dallas, Texas, waterworks bonds at a 5.377 percent true interest cost.</p>
</text>
